---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Stats from "../components/Stats";
import HomeRank from "../components/HomeRank";
import Ledger from "../components/Ledger";
import Sponsors from "../components/Sponsors";
import Design from "../components/Design";
---

<Base>
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 pt-8 pb-24">
    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="pt-10 pb-6 mb-4">
      <div class="flex items-baseline gap-3 mb-4">
        <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl font-black tracking-[-0.05em] leading-[0.5]">解字</h1>
        <span class="text-sm text-vermillion font-mono tracking-widest uppercase">jiě zì</span>
      </div>

      <p class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold leading-snug mb-3">
        让 <span class="font-mono text-vermillion">600</span> 名大学生免费用上 AI 编程工具
      </p>

      <p class="text-sm text-ink-muted leading-relaxed mb-5">
        发起人投入 15 万元启动资金，加上赞助方的支持，给你 <span class="term" data-tip="调用 AI 模型的额度，支持 Claude、Gemini、GPT、DeepSeek 等 20+ 模型">API Token</span>、云服务器，还有 1v1 辅导和项目曝光。不限专业，不限基础。
      </p>

      <div class="mb-6 flex items-center gap-4">
        <a href="/apply" class="inline-block bg-vermillion text-white font-medium text-sm px-6 py-3 hover:bg-vermillion-hover transition-colors">
          申请资助
        </a>
        <a href="https://learn.jieziai.cn" class="text-sm text-ink-muted hover:text-ink font-mono transition-colors">
          学习资源 →
        </a>
      </div>

      <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted border-l-2 border-vermillion pl-3">
        「解字」取自<a href="https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%AF%B4%E6%96%87%E8%A7%A3%E5%AD%97" class="text-vermillion hover:underline">《说文解字》</a>——字是语言最小的构成单位，token 是大模型最小的构成单位。
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Stats (client-side, fetches from API) -->
    <Stats client:load />

    <!-- Top explorers -->
    <HomeRank client:load />

    <!-- Why -->
    <section class="mb-24">
      <div class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-serif">背景</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="border-l-2 border-vermillion pl-4">
        <p class="text-ink leading-relaxed">
          公元 100 年，许慎写成<a href="https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%AF%B4%E6%96%87%E8%A7%A3%E5%AD%97" class="text-vermillion hover:underline">《说文解字》</a>，将九千多个汉字拆解到最小的构件——部首。两千年后，语言的最小单位变了，叫 <span class="term" data-tip="大语言模型处理信息的最小单位，相当于语言的'原子'">token</span>。
        </p>
      </div>

      <p class="mt-6 text-ink leading-relaxed">
        大语言模型将文字、代码、推理拆解为 token 来处理。谁拥有足够的 token，谁就能让 AI 为自己工作。Token 之于 AI，正如文字之于知识——掌握它的人获得力量，被挡在门外的人只能旁观。
      </p>

      <div class="mt-8 bg-ink/[0.03] p-6 border-l-2 border-ink-muted">
        <p class="text-ink italic leading-relaxed">
          "所有的年轻人都知道不会用 AI 就找不到工作，但他们只能每个月浅尝辄止。Token 太贵了，Claude MAX 就是他们一半的生活费。"
        </p>
        <a href="https://x.com/CTracy0803/status/2038452420330811482" class="text-xs font-mono text-ink-muted hover:text-vermillion transition-colors mt-4 inline-block">— @CTracy0803，1160 likes</a>
      </div>

      <p class="mt-6 text-lg font-medium text-ink">
        《说文解字》让文字不再是贵族的专属。解字计划要做同样的事：让 token 不再是大学生的门槛。
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Stages -->
    <section class="mb-24">
      <div class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-serif">三个阶段</h2>
      </div>

      <p class="text-ink-muted mb-8">
        体验 → 实践 → 长期支持。你走多远，我们就支持多远。
      </p>

      <div class="space-y-6">
        <!-- Stage 1 -->
        <div class="border-l border-vermillion/40 bg-ink/[0.02] rounded-sm p-6">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-baseline">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold font-serif">体验期 · 600 人</h3>
            <span class="border border-vermillion/30 text-vermillion text-xs font-serif px-1.5 py-0.5">1 个月</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-ink-muted mt-1">让每一个想接触 AI 的大学生，都有机会亲手体验。</p>

          <div class="mt-4 space-y-1 text-sm">
            <span class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-vermillion">·</span><span class="term" data-tip="调用 AI 模型的额度，支持 Claude、Gemini、GPT、DeepSeek 等 20+ 模型">$20 API Token</span>，支持 <a href="https://claude.ai/code" class="text-vermillion hover:underline">Claude Code</a>、<a href="https://cline.bot" class="text-vermillion hover:underline">Cline</a>、Cursor 等</span>
            <span class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-vermillion">·</span>无条件赠送，不要求提交成果，有效期 1 个月</span>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-border/50 text-xs text-ink-muted">
            <p class="font-mono uppercase tracking-wider">申请方式：提交 <span class="term" data-tip="在 GitHub 提交 Issue，填入你的申请码">Issue</span> · 每批 100 人 · 先到先得</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Stage 2 -->
        <div class="border-l-2 border-vermillion bg-ink/[0.02] rounded-sm p-6">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-baseline">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold font-serif">深度资助 · ~60 人</h3>
            <span class="border border-vermillion/30 text-vermillion text-xs font-serif px-1.5 py-0.5">3 个月</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-ink-muted mt-1">体验过了，接下来用 AI 做点真东西出来。</p>

          <div class="mt-4 space-y-1 text-sm">
            <span class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-vermillion">·</span>$100 API Token · 有效期 3 个月</span>
            <span class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-vermillion">·</span>云服务器 · 1 年</span>
            <span class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-vermillion">·</span><span class="term" data-tip="在你自己的应用中调用 AI 的额度，让 AI 成为你产品的一部分">API Token</span> · $50 额度</span>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-4 space-y-1 text-sm">
            <span class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-vermillion">·</span>发起人（前 <a href="https://manus.im" class="text-vermillion hover:underline">Manus AI</a> 工程师，1.5 万粉丝）1v1 交流</span>
            <span class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-vermillion">·</span>优秀项目在社交媒体曝光推荐</span>
            <span class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-vermillion">·</span>实习机会对接</span>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-border/50 text-xs text-ink-muted">
            <p class="font-mono uppercase tracking-wider">条件：50 <span class="term" data-tip="GitHub 上的点赞/收藏数，代表有多少人认可你的项目">star</span> 的 GitHub 项目 + 发起人评审</p>
            <p class="mt-2">达到 50 star 即可解锁 1v1 交流，无论是否通过评审。</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Stage 3 -->
        <div class="border-l-4 border-vermillion bg-ink/[0.02] rounded-sm p-6">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-baseline">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold font-serif">长期资助 · 3-5 人</h3>
            <span class="border border-vermillion/30 text-vermillion text-xs font-serif px-1.5 py-0.5">1 年</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-ink-muted mt-1">持续学习的人，值得持续的支持。</p>

          <div class="mt-4 space-y-1 text-sm">
            <span class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-vermillion">·</span><span class="term" data-tip="调用 AI 模型的额度，支持 Claude、Gemini、GPT、DeepSeek 等 20+ 模型">$400 API Token</span> · 有效期 12 个月</span>
            <span class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-vermillion">·</span>与发起人高频沟通，持续指导</span>
            <span class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-vermillion">·</span>项目宣传和资源对接</span>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-border/50 text-xs text-ink-muted">
            <p class="font-mono uppercase tracking-wider">条件：从第二阶段中选拔 · 综合评估</p>
            <p class="mt-2">我们关注的不是谁最厉害，而是你是否在持续成长、做的东西是否解决了真实问题。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- How to Apply -->
    <section id="apply" class="mb-24">
      <div class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-serif">申请</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="border-y border-border py-6">
          <h3 class="font-serif font-bold mb-3">用 <span class="term" data-tip="AI 编程 Agent，能自主帮你完成编程任务的 AI 工具">code agent</span> 申请</h3>
          <div class="bg-ink/[0.03] p-4 font-mono text-sm mt-3 border-l border-ink/10">
            我要申请 jiezi-ai/grant
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted mt-3">
            在 <a href="https://claude.ai/code" class="text-vermillion hover:underline">Claude Code</a>、<a href="https://cursor.com" class="text-vermillion hover:underline">Cursor</a> 或 <a href="https://cline.bot" class="text-vermillion hover:underline">Cline</a> 中说这句话，agent 会自动完成全部流程——如果你还不会，没关系，这正是我们想帮你学会的。
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border-y border-border py-6">
          <h3 class="font-serif font-bold mb-3">三步完成申请</h3>
          <ol class="text-sm list-decimal pl-5 space-y-3 text-ink-muted">
            <li>在 <a href="/apply" class="text-vermillion hover:underline font-medium">jieziai.cn/apply</a> 填写信息，获取申请码</li>
            <li>到 <a href="https://github.com/jiezi-ai/grant/issues/new?template=apply.yml" class="text-vermillion hover:underline">GitHub 提交 Issue</a>，填入申请码</li>
            <li>查收 edu 邮箱验证邮件，点击验证链接</li>
          </ol>
          <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted mt-4">
            验证完成后 AI 编程资源自动发放到你的邮箱。个人信息不会出现在 Issue 中。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Design Philosophy -->
    <Design client:load />

    <!-- Founder -->
    <section class="mb-24">
      <div class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-serif">发起人</h2>
      </div>

      <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-ink">
        我是 <a href="https://x.com/yan5xu" class="text-vermillion hover:underline">@yan5xu</a>（许长鹏），前 <a href="https://manus.im" class="text-vermillion hover:underline">Manus AI</a> & <a href="https://monica.im" class="text-vermillion hover:underline">Monica AI</a> 工程师。2023 年加入 AI Agent 浪潮，参与构建了 Manus 和 Monica（1000 万用户）。离开后投入开源社区，创建了 <a href="https://github.com/nicepkg/pinix" class="text-vermillion hover:underline">Pinix</a> 和 <a href="https://github.com/nicepkg/bb-browser" class="text-vermillion hover:underline">bb-browser</a>。
      </p>

      <p class="mt-4 text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">
        我也曾是大学生。明明知道一个工具能改变自己的轨迹，却因为成本只能浅尝辄止——这种感受我理解。AI 给了我很多，我想回馈一些。
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Sponsors -->
    <Sponsors client:load />

    <!-- Transparency -->
    <section class="mb-24">
      <div class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-serif">公开透明</h2>
      </div>

      <p class="text-ink-muted mb-6">
        每一分钱花在哪里，所有规则怎么定的，全部公开，谁都能查。
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        {[
          { label: "政策", path: "policy/", url: "https://github.com/jiezi-ai/grant/tree/main/policy" },
          { label: "预算", path: "BUDGET.md", url: "https://github.com/jiezi-ai/grant/blob/main/BUDGET.md" },
          { label: "时间线", path: "TIMELINE.md", url: "https://github.com/jiezi-ai/grant/blob/main/TIMELINE.md" },
          { label: "支出记录", path: "records/spending.md", url: "https://github.com/jiezi-ai/grant/blob/main/records/spending.md" },
          { label: "批次记录", path: "records/batches.md", url: "https://github.com/jiezi-ai/grant/blob/main/records/batches.md" },
          { label: "账本", path: "ledger/", url: "https://github.com/jiezi-ai/grant/tree/main/ledger" },
        ].map(item => (
          <a href={item.url} class="block border border-border p-4 hover:border-vermillion transition-colors group flex justify-between items-start">
            <div>
              <span class="font-serif font-bold text-sm group-hover:text-vermillion">{item.label}</span>
              <span class="block text-[11px] text-ink-muted mt-1 font-mono uppercase tracking-tighter">{item.path}</span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-ink-muted group-hover:text-vermillion transition-colors text-sm">→</span>
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Budget -->
    <section class="mb-24">
      <div class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-serif">预算分配</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="border-y-2 border-ink py-4 font-mono text-sm">
        <div class="divide-y divide-dashed divide-border/50">
          <div class="flex justify-between py-2">
            <span>第一阶段 · 体验期</span>
            <div class="flex gap-4">
              <span>86,400 元</span>
              <span class="text-ink-muted w-10 text-right">47%</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between py-2">
            <span>第二阶段 · 深度资助</span>
            <div class="flex gap-4">
              <span>67,200 元</span>
              <span class="text-ink-muted w-10 text-right">37%</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between py-2">
            <span>第三阶段 · 长期资助</span>
            <div class="flex gap-4">
              <span>14,400 元</span>
              <span class="text-ink-muted w-10 text-right">8%</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between py-2">
            <span>运营成本</span>
            <div class="flex gap-4">
              <span>14,880 元</span>
              <span class="text-ink-muted w-10 text-right">8%</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t-2 border-ink pt-2 mt-2 flex justify-between font-bold">
          <span>理论上限</span>
          <div class="flex gap-4">
            <span>182,880 元</span>
            <span class="text-ink-muted w-10 text-right">100%</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[10px] text-ink-muted mt-2">API Token 按量计费，到期回收未使用额度，实际支出预计远低于上限</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Ledger (client-side, fetches from API) -->
      <Ledger client:load />
    </section>

    <!-- Media -->
    <section class="mb-24">
      <div class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-serif">讨论</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3">
        {[
          { platform: "公众号", title: "解字计划：给 600 个大学生赞助 AI Token", url: "https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/k8cj_jWQp6IJqwVMR6HQUA" },
          { platform: "即刻", title: "@yan5xu 的即刻动态", url: "https://web.okjike.com/u/E69EEA30-86D6-4378-A47D-06546A9F9262/post/6a06724b7f82528246fd32bd" },
          { platform: "小红书", title: "解字计划：给 600 个大学生赞助 AI Token", url: "https://www.xiaohongshu.com/discovery/item/6a06734f0000000008027332" },
          { platform: "知乎", title: "解字计划：给 600 个大学生赞助 AI Token", url: "https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2038554036429927079" },
        ].map(item => (
          <a href={item.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="block border border-border p-4 hover:border-vermillion transition-colors group flex justify-between items-center">
            <div>
              <span class="text-xs text-ink-muted font-mono mr-2">{item.platform}</span>
              <span class="text-sm group-hover:text-vermillion">{item.title}</span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-ink-muted group-hover:text-vermillion transition-colors text-sm">→</span>
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer class="mt-32 pt-12 border-t border-border text-center pb-12">
      <div class="text-sm text-ink-muted mb-8 space-y-2">
        <p>
          <a href="https://x.com/yan5xu" class="text-vermillion hover:underline">@yan5xu</a>
          &nbsp;·&nbsp;
          <a href="https://github.com/jiezi-ai/grant" class="text-vermillion hover:underline">GitHub</a>
          &nbsp;·&nbsp;
          <a href="https://github.com/jiezi-ai/grant/tree/main/policy" class="text-vermillion hover:underline">政策</a>
        </p>
        <p class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest">
          <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/" class="underline hover:text-vermillion">CC BY 4.0</a>
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="inline-block bg-vermillion text-white font-serif text-xs px-3 py-1.5 select-none hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300" style="clip-path: polygon(2% 0%, 100% 1%, 98% 100%, 0% 98%)">
        解字
      </div>
    </footer>
  </main>
</Base>
